Wisprsight selectively includes Lipflow inference and preprocessing code at revision
e37453b1e1e125ca7130e4abf2635117635f6e0b (https://github.com/amywork777/lipflow).
Original MIT license and upstream notices are in vendor/licenses/.

vendor/espnet contains Apache-2.0 ESPnet/Auto-AVSR code, including upstream copyright
notices. vendor/lipflow/face.py, vsr.py, train_vsr.py and preprocessing assets derive
from Lipflow and Auto-AVSR. The paths and tokenizer modules are reduced integrations.

Model checkpoints are downloaded separately and are not included in this repository.
LRS3-derived weights are treated as noncommercial research artifacts pending an
independent audit. No claim of commercial model rights is made.

UI components in frontend/src/components/{button,sonner,select,sidebar,card,tooltip,dropdown-menu,shimmer}
are installed directly from the official Notra shadcn registry, configured in
frontend/components.json. Base UI foundation components are in components/ui.
Registry sources: https://ui.usenotra.com/r/notra-button.json,
https://ui.usenotra.com/r/notra-sonner.json,
https://ui.usenotra.com/r/notra-select.json,
https://ui.usenotra.com/r/notra-sidebar.json and https://ui.usenotra.com/r/card.json.
The earlier reduced button adapter has been removed.

Browser audio inference uses Hugging Face Transformers.js (Apache-2.0), installed
from npm. The separate ONNX Whisper base.en artifacts come from
https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/whisper-base.en at revision
51eefc0af78b103839eda9e7e4f4186acc6517fe. Their upstream model is OpenAI Whisper.
Audio teacher weights are downloaded separately and remain outside Git.
